{"unit_id":"M0Yun__dsh-cookie-guard#card-zh","repo":"M0Yun/dsh-cookie-guard","commit":"1a0b4be765b344d992f7c277da3fb3f8f18491d4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cookie-guard 是面向 Windows 桌面端的 DSH 插件，用来清理长期累积的登录 Cookie。它在 Host 启动时挂起独立后台清理器，等 DSH 退出、Cookies 数据库解锁后删除旧的 dsh-auth-* Cookie，并保留其他 Cookie。插件提供 cookie_guard 工具，可查看数据库和清理器状态，也可触发清理。适合遇到旧登录 Cookie 堆积问题的 Windows 桌面用户；需要 Node.js 22.5+ 内置的 node:sqlite。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:196-260","lib/cleaner.mjs:89-114"]}
{"unit_id":"M0Yun__dsh-cookie-guard#card-en","repo":"M0Yun/dsh-cookie-guard","commit":"1a0b4be765b344d992f7c277da3fb3f8f18491d4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cookie-guard cleans accumulated DSH login cookies on Windows. A detached cleaner starts with the Host and deletes old dsh-auth-* cookies after DSH exits. The cookie_guard tool reports status or triggers cleanup. It requires Node.js 22.5+ with node:sqlite.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:196-260","lib/cleaner.mjs:89-114"]}
